      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D7684FF01000A90A3621151C659074E004E0B54E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，那个……\n您的钱好像不够。",
